00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:08.668
wait to see and read the indictment.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:09.903
I'm just predicting

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:12.205
there will be a lot of people surprised

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:13.473
at the level of evidence

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:15.241
