00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.361
that he was ready to repudiate,

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.797
and he's innocent until proven guilty.

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:40.233
So let's at least start with that note.

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.501
So so just to be clear, though,

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:41.968
you're saying

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.570
you think from what you understand,

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:44.938
your exposure to the grand jury,

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.139
your client, Michael Cohen,

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:49.142
obviously central to this testifying

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:50.276
