00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:51.211
that you believe

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:53.546
that there is going to be an indictment

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:54.981
for multiple crimes

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:56.049
because of the evidence

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:59.652
that that you're aware of One question.

