00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:07.026
But, yes,

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:08.695
I have no doubt

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:11.064
After months and months, months

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:14.067
of being exposed to this case and Mr.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:14.501
Cohen

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:16.035
being questioned about the case

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:18.271
and observing this group of professional

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:22.108
or meticulous, careful, very discrete

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:24.944
prosecutors, that this is about facts,

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:27.580
documents, text messages,

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:30.083
other witnesses, not just Mr.

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:30.783
Cohen.

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:33.153
It's a very strong factual case.

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.187
I heard Mr.

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:34.621
Harding

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.389
