00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:03.483
that his expectation would be

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:04.684
that they would

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:06.052
try to charge for a felony,

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:07.153
not just a misdemeanor,

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:09.689
