00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.257
No doubt there are

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:13.459
there are felony violations

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:15.228
if the evidence beyond a reasonable

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:17.230
doubt is presented to a jury.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.465
I think this is a much stronger case

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:21.000
than people recognize

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.435
attacking Michael Cohen,

00:03:22.435 --> 00:03:23.036
which is

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:24.871
Donald Trump's way of deflecting

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:25.672
and accusing

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:26.973
and personalizing

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:28.174
he's going to be based

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:29.909
in American public opinion.

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:31.744
Right, left, Trump or not

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:32.845
are going to be faced

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:34.080
with a lot of evidence

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.515
that will surprise them.

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:38.051
A lot of witnesses a lot of documents.

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:39.252
It's not just about

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:41.120
one person's testimony.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.323
And I think everyone who is out there

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:44.557
talking about this

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:45.925
being a political case

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:47.794
