00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.864
of what these prosecutors have developed

00:03:52.098 --> 00:03:53.967
in several criminal charges.

00:03:53.967 --> 00:03:54.434
All right.

00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:55.702
And of course, as I have to keep

00:03:55.702 --> 00:03:57.437
emphasizing, right, uncharted territory.

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:57.870
We don't know

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.439
